<title>SWEDEN: Sweden sets auction of 6.0 bln skr T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden sets auction of 6.0 bln skr T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would invite bids from the market for an auction of six billion crowns worth of Treasury bills.</p>
<p>It will invite bids for 1.2 billion crowns of six-month T-bills and 4.8 billion crowns of one-year T-bills.</p>
<p>The auction will take place on September 25, it said, and bids are due at 1030 GMT on the day of the auction. Settlement date is September 27.  </p>
